# retry — a BUNDLED feature, implemented by this package for its own target.
#
# This is what a real language package does: it implements the standard
# feature set rather than redefining it. It is also what makes the consumer
# side trim catalogue testable — for a consumer that does not select `retry`,
# `target add wtest` must remove this file; for one that does, it must
# survive; and doctor must stay clean either way.

feature retry
backoff exponential
